<opsproc code="00009495.0001001" revdate="2014-05-12T14:50:16"><title><abb>DC</abb> Main Generation (<abb>TR</abb> 2 inoperative)</title><procitem layer="1" lid="N.00009495.0001001.014"><title>Flight preparation/Limitations</title><procbody lid="N.00009495.0001001.015"><inform layer="1" lid="N.00009495.0001001.016"><para code="00009495.0001001.012" layer="1" lid="N.00009495.0001001.017">Maximum
landing capability is CAT 3 SINGLE.</para></inform></procbody></procitem><procitem layer="1" lid="N.00009495.0001001.018"><title>During preliminary cockpit preparation</title><procbody lid="N.00009495.0001001.019"><action layer="1" lid="N.00009495.0001001.021" memory="false"><cr-action code="00009495.0001001.013"><challenge><tech-label type="cb">TR 2/CNTOR/SPLY (124VU BC01)</tech-label></challenge><response>Pull</response></cr-action><comment code="00009495.0001001.024"><para layer="1" lid="N.00009495.0001001.038">On the <tech-label type="s-page">ELEC</tech-label>, disregard the indications related to the deactivated <abb>TR</abb> 2.</para></comment></action><action layer="1" lid="N.00009495.0001001.022" memory="false"><command code="00009495.0001001.014"><para layer="1" lid="N.00009495.0001001.023">On the <tech-label type="s-page">ELEC</tech-label>, check that the <abb>TR</abb> 1and the <abb>ESS</abb> <abb>TR</abb> voltages are both equal to or above <measure category="Electricity" show-unit="true" system="SI" unit="V">27</measure>.</para></command></action><action layer="1" lid="N.00009495.0001001.024" memory="false"><command code="00009495.0001001.025"><para layer="1" lid="N.00009495.0001001.039">The batteries must be set to
OFF for the following check: On the battery voltage indicator, check
that the <abb>BAT</abb> 1 and the <abb>BAT</abb> 2 voltages are both
equal to or above <measure category="Electricity" show-unit="true" system="SI" unit="V">25.5</measure>.</para></command></action><action layer="1" lid="N.00009495.0001001.027" memory="false"><cr-action code="00009495.0001001.017"><challenge><tech-label type="pb-sw">AC ESS FEED</tech-label></challenge><response>ALTN</response></cr-action></action></procbody></procitem><procitem layer="1" lid="N.00009495.0001001.028"><title>In flight</title><procbody lid="N.00009495.0001001.029"><condition at-any-time="false" code="00009495.0001001.018" direct="false" layer="1" lid="N.00009495.0001001.030" subtitle="false" type="cond"><intro>In the case of failure of the <abb>AC</abb> BUS 2, all <abb>DU</abb>s are lost. In this case:</intro><procbody lid="N.00009495.0001001.031"><action layer="1" lid="N.00009495.0001001.032" memory="false"><cr-action code="00009495.0001001.019"><challenge><tech-label type="pb-sw">AC ESS FEED</tech-label></challenge><response>Norm</response></cr-action></action></procbody></condition><condition at-any-time="false" code="00009495.0001001.021" direct="false" layer="1" lid="N.00009495.0001001.034" subtitle="false" type="cond"><intro>In the case of failure of the <abb>AC</abb> BUS 1:</intro><procbody lid="N.00009495.0001001.036"><action layer="1" lid="N.00009495.0001001.037" memory="false"><cr-action code="00009495.0001001.023"><challenge><tech-label type="pb-sw">RAT MAN ON</tech-label> (on HYD overhead panel)</challenge><response>Set</response></cr-action></action></procbody></condition></procbody></procitem></opsproc>